<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Izirakaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Izirakaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Izirakaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iz.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Izirakaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iziraki Maxaaf lamiinge odoka Maxaafa hordofaake kadaa wodda mammaaka'neexxinna heenoki Yihudiinki booji'emeemmaki manni Babilonii'ni higeexxanna Iyyerussaalemi giddo hedhotixxinna magenoonfachchotixxi haaroonsensha kaddeexxenni; kunni yaaduwwinna konneechchinni butti'a shiqe'ekeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Faarisike moyanjike Qiroosike ajajinni sirete'n Yihudiinki booji'ememmaki manni Baabiloonii'ni higeeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Galma qammachchine eebbinse; Magenokanna Iyyerussaalemi giddo magenoonfachchote'n ke'ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Heddo wogga uduma Mageniinka seera muuxemmake Iziraxxe akeekisanjummanni weli Yihudiinki booji'emeemmaki manni Iyyerussaalemi'a hige; Izira ulfeessemeeki miyi hedhemmaba hiissatee ardi ulfinniinxanna maaliinxa hedho higgeenna giissedho'a insa'nee garigaare.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudiinki booji'emeemmaki manni ifike bogiba'a higeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-2:70">1:1—2:70</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tolchimalchi haaroba ijaaremeexxanna galmiinka ijarsa sanfeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 3:1-4:6">3:1—4:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyerussaalemi haaroba ijaaraa'na gelteexxa rakko <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 4:6-23">4:6-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galmiinxi huje muuxendeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 4:24-6:22">4:24—6:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Izira Yihudiinka arda Iyyerussaalemi'a adhdhe me'eexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 7:1-8:36">7:1—8:36</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Izira gosa gosake ardixxa melaalle aadheemmaki labballi usurrakenna'ni tikemaashsha assexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 9:1-10:44">9:1—10:44</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Qiroosi Booji'emeemmaki Manni Higaashsha Ajajeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Qiroosi Faarsike moyanjo kadeexxe siretixxe wogga'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Qiroosika yaada ke'isseexxi isi moyaammake boga duuchcha'n lallabemashshanna kunninni lallabi kinni borreesseme uggemaashsha assise; tinninna kaddeechchi Ermiyaasike afo'o'ni haaso'emeemmak Mageniink hiyyichchi muuxemo'aatemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Erm. 25:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />Faarsik moyanji Qiroosi lallabe'e hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti iimik Mageni buttatixxa mootumma duuchcha ane'ni uwwe'eeni; Yihudiinke boga'ni hexxeexxe Iyyerusaalemi'ninna isi'a galma iijaaronna'a anee'e ajaje'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:28">Isa. 44:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Ha'no giddo isike manjo kade'eek duuchchiingenni Mageni welti hedhowwaali; isi Yihudiinke bogi giddo hexxeexxe Iyyerusaalemi'a, alalle mareexxi ookko hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Gootta, Isira'eelike Magenka galma ijaarowwaali. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Hedhe hedheenxe bakka'n gataak hoone bogik manni duuchchinna Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke Mageniinke galmi'a uwwatee kadaashsha ififike yaadinni shiqishaaxxe uwwa gadhi darre lebeexxi birretika sibiljonna worqe, miyuwwakanna hore uwwa'n insa'nee'e gargaarowwaali» <verse eid="EZR 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni yaada ke'isseeki Yihudiinkinna Biiniyaamike mannik akeekisanjuwwi, ittanni qeesetinna Leewwito duuchchi marteexxi Iyyerusaalemi giddo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a galma ijaarro'a qophpheefante. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Olla'i insa'neki duuchchi feedhi ifixxinni uwweexxe uwwa gadhi darre lebeexxi birretike sibiljika, worqetika miyuwwa, horuwwakanna wele la'o affeexxa uwwa duuchcha uwwiyyoti gargaarre. <verse eid="EZR 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Konnechchuwwa waalini moyanji Qiroosi, Naabukedenetsoori Iyyerusaalemi'n aadheexxi ifike magenuwwi mine'ni uggeemmaka Mageniinke minika woyyichcha miyuwwa fulche. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Faarsik moyanji Qiroosi myuwiinke minika sooreessa Mitridaaxu darre'ni woyyichchi mi'uwwi dageexxi Yihudaka galchallo Seesabisaari edo laakko'emaashsha asse. <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Mi'uwwiinkinna konnechchinni butti'a hedheekeramman, 30 Worqetixxi qoruwwa, mitte kuma sibiljiinxa qoruwwa, 29 ferritte sibiljiinxa qoruwwa, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />30 hubbuqqitte sibiljiinxa qoruwwa, 410 birretike sibiljixxa hubbuqqitte qoruwwa, mitte kuma wele mi'uwwa. <verse eid="EZR 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Duuchchingelchi mittenba onde kumanna shoole dhibba birretike sibiljiinkenna worqetike miyuwwamman; booji'emeek manni Baabilooni'n Iyyerusaalemi'a higaa wodda Seesabisaari konne duuchchiinga miya aadhe fule.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Boga ifikeba'a Higeeke Booji'otike Mannika laakkossa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NEH 7:4-73">Neh. 7:4-73</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Baabiloonki moyanji Naabukedenetsoori booji'eexxi Baabilooni'a adhdhe me'emmake manni giddi'n boji'otenaa'n higeexxi ifi ifinge qachchuwwibaa Yihudi'aanna Iyyerusaalemi'a dageek ookkone bogiink manni, <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />ifinqile dageeki akeekisanjuwwi Zerubaabeli, Iyyaasu, Nehimiyaa, Seraya, Re'eelayaa, Merdokiyoosi, Bilishaani, Misipaare, Bigiwwaayi, Reehumii, Be'aana hinne ye'naakeeran; mitti mittinge Isira'eelike manni hadinaa'ni bukki hiyye ifike bogibaa higeekik laakkoossi konneechchinni butti'a hedheekeni: <verse eid="EZR 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Faaroosixxi horte lame kumanna dhibbakanna torbaane tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Sefaxiyaasixxi horte sase dhibbanna torbaane tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Arahixxi horte torbaane dhibbanna torbaane tommenna onde <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Iyyaasuxxinna Iyyo'aabixxi horte kadde'eexxi Fehaati Mo'aabixxi horte lame kumanna saddeeta dhibbanna tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Eelaamixxi horte mitte kumanna lame dhibbanna onde tommenna shoole <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Zaatu'ixxi horte sallane dhibbanna shoole tommenna onde <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Zekkayixxi horte torabaane dhibbanna jaane tomme <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Baanixxi horte jaane dhibbanna shoole tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Bebaayixxi horte jaane dhibbanna lame tommenna sase <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Azigaadixxi horte mitte kumanna lame dhibbanna lame tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Adooniqaamixxi horte jaane dhibbanna jaane tommenna jaane <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Bigiwwayixxi horte lame kumanna onde tommenna jaane <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Adinixxi horte shoole dhibbanna onde tommenna shoole <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Hiziqiyaasike beltixxi Axuurixxi horte sallane tommenna saddeeta <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Bedaayixxi horte sase dhibbanna lame tommenna sase <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Yoorahixxi horte dhibbakanna tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Hashuumixxi horte lame dhibbanna lame tommenna sase <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Gaaberixxi horte sallane tommenna onde <verse eid="EZR 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Beetelihemiki manni dhibbakanna lame tommenna sase <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Nexoofaki manni onde tommenna jaane <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Anaatootiki manni dhibbakanna lame tommenna saddeeta <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Azimootixxi horte shoole tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Qiriyatiyi'aarimixxi, Kefiiranna Be'eerotixxi horte torbaane dhibbanna shoole tommenna sase <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Raamaxxinna Geba'ixxi horte jaane dhibbanna lame tommenna mitte <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Maakimaasiki manni dhibbakanna lame tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Beeti'eelikinna Gayiki manni lame dhibbanna lame tommenna sase <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Naabawixxi horte onde tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Magibisixxi horte dhibbakanna onde tommenna jaane <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Eelaamixxi wele horte mitte kumanna lame dhibbanna onde tommenna shoole <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Hariimixxi horte sase dhibbanna lame tomme <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Loodixxi, Hadaadixxinna Oonoixxi horte torbaane dhibbanna lame tommenna onde <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Iyyaarikoki manni sase dhibbanna shoole tommenna onde <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Sena'axxi horte sase kumanna jaane dhibbanna sase tome <verse eid="EZR 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Qeesole: Iyyaasuke mini ga'mii'ni Yooda'iyaxxi horte sallane dhibbanna torbaane tommenna sase <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Imeerixxi horte kumakenna onde tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Fasikoorixxi horte kumakenna lame dhibbanna shoole tommenna torbaane <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Hariimixxi horte kumakenna tommenna torbaane <verse eid="EZR 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Leewwito: Hodaawiya gamii'n Iyyaasuxxinna Qadimi'eelixxi horte torbaane tommenna shoole <verse eid="EZR 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Faarsaalleeyye: Asaafixxi horte kumakanna lame tommenna saddeeta <verse eid="EZR 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Mageniinke Galmixxe hulaki heqqanjuwwi: Seeloomixxi, Axeerixxi, Xalmoonixxi, Aquubixxi, Haxiixaxxinna Sobayixxi horte kumakanna sase tommenna sallane <verse eid="EZR 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Mageniinke Galmiinka erganjuwwa Siihaxxi, Hasuufaxxinna Xebi'ootixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />Keeraasixxi, Sii'axxi, Faadoonixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />Libaanaxxi, Hagaabaxxi, Aquubixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />Hagaabixxi, Semilayixxi, Hananixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />Gedeelixxi, Gaaherixxi, Raayaxxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />Re'asoonixxi, Neqoodaxxi, Gaazaamixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />Oozaxxi, Faaseehaxxi, Beesayixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />Asinaxxi, Mi'unaawiki manni, Nifuusesiimike mannixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />Baaqibuqqixxi, Haquufaxxi, Harhuurixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />Besilootixxi, Mihidaxxi, Harishaaxxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />Baariqoosixxi, Siisaaraxxi, Teemaxxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />Nisiyaanaxxinna, Haxiifaxxi, horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Solomoonke erganjuwwixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />Ya'ilaxxi, Dariqonixxi Gideelixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />Sefaxiyaasixxi, Haxilixxi, Fekiraatixxi, Hatsiiboyimixxi, Amixxi horte, <verse eid="EZR 2:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Mageniinke Galmiinke erganjuwwixxinna Solomoonike erganjuwwixxi horte sase dhibbanna sallane tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Konnechchinni butti'a hedheek kinni Teelmeelake, Teelaareesake, Keruubike, Adaanikenna Imeerike qachchuwinaa'n dageekerani; yaane kinni insa'ne ifike mini hadi Isira'eelixxe horte darree'nite kandeexxa kokeessa dadndeennebaan. <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Delaayaxxi, Xobiyaxxinna Neeqoodaxxi horte jaane dhibbanna onde tommenna lame <verse eid="EZR 2:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Qeese giddii'n Eebbiyaxxi, Aaqoosixxinna Berizilaayixxi horte, Berizilaayi konne summinni ye'emeechchi Gele'adichcho Berizilaayixxa belto aadhemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Kunni manni, hundaayye insa'neexxike mini hadik summi ilatike maxaafa giddo haseme leellebaan; tennexxee insa'ne ca'a hinebaaxxa uudemmeexxi qeesummatixxe ergatenshanaa'n lagemme. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Bogiink galchallinna insa'nee, Uriiminninna Tuumiiminni Mageno qodhdhaak qeesichchi hariiremaa qico'ni hara woyyitte ita indabashsha insa'nee ajaje.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Lak. 29:12-38</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 2:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Booji'otenaa'n illee iima hige'emmake mannik laakkoossi shoole tommenna lame kuma sase dhibbanna jaane tommeman; <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />kunni laakkoossinna torbaane kumanna sase dhibbanna sase tommenna torbaane insa'neeke labbakinna meyyak erganjuwwi gadhi darremman; insa'ne lame dhibba labbakanna meyyaxxa faarsaalleeyye anfeemman. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Torbaane dhibbanna sase tommenna jaane fadhado, lame dhibbanna shoole tommenna onde gaange, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />Shoole dhibbanna sase tommenna onde gaaluwanna jaane kumanna torbaane dhibbanna lame tomme harre anfeemmani. <verse eid="EZR 2:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Insa'ne Iyyerusaalemi hedheeki Duuchchi Woddike Gootti mine'ni gennee wodda, mitti mitti mini hadiki akeekisanjuwwi, edike booncho'ni qammalchema'neeke mini'a fedhi ifixxi'n uwwa shiqinshe. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Ifi ifixxe dande'ashshanni jaani tomminna mitte kuma worqe daarike onde kuma sibiljo birre, dhibba qeesole oddo'witaaxxa seemma miya massinaammake mine'ni uune. <verse eid="EZR 2:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Qeesle, Leewwitto, Faarisaalleeyye, hulatik heqqanjuwwinna Mageniinke galmik erganjuwwi, wele mannini welti ifi ifinge qachcha'n ofolle; weli gateeki Isira'eeliki ardinna ifi ifinge qachcha'n ofo'le.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:70 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:2">1 Odo. 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:3">Neh. 11:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">Tolchimalchi Qammalcheme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Torbaki agenji geyee wodda, Isira'eelik ardi ifi ifinge qachcha'ni hedha'neege'ni, iikki ardi mitte manjishsha kade Iyyerusaalemi bukki hiyye. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyooseedeqiki belti Iyyaasunna isik firi qeese ittanni Selaatiyaatiki belti Zerubaabeelinna isik hujetik jaaluwwi, Mageniinka manjo Muuseke seera'ni borreesendemmashsha ciincatika tolichcha shiqishatee, Isira'eelike Magenika tolchimalichcho giissa sanfe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1">Fula. 27:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Qarqara insa'neeke'ni hedheeka arda sodaantoolenna tolchimalichcho edinxe isixxe booso'ninni giissine; tolchimalichchoke'ninna gorsanna galgala shiqaaka cincatika tolcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqinshe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:1-8">Lak. 28:1-8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Ookkoneechchi uduma barra barra'nde'e ajajendemmashshanni geyaake laakkoossi qico ciincatika tolcha shiqishati fooqiinka ayyaana boreessememmashshanni ulfeessine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Lak. 29:12-38</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma duuhchchin wodda shiqaammaka ciincatika tolcha, reefi baate fuldamma woddika tolcha, woyyichcha Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ayyaana'n shiqaammaka tolchanna fedhi ifixxen Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwemaammaka tolcha shiqinshe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:11-29:39">Lak. 28:11—29:39</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmiki ijaarsi safema gophe'eexxe kaddoolenna torbake agenjixxe siretixxe barra'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ciincatika tolcha shiqinshe.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galmi qammalcheme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'ne kino boce giissaammakeri'anna mine ijaaraammake manni'a maallaqa uune; Faarsika moyanjo Xiiroosike ajajishshanni birbirsiinka haqqichchuwwa Libaanoosinaa'n Iyyophexxe abbaayya hana insa'ne'a iyyedago'a Siidoonakenna Qiroosike manni'a ita, ha'wokanna zayite uune. <verse eid="EZR 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke Mageniinke miniba'a genneexxe langaxxe woggake langake agenjo'n, Selaatiyaaliki belti Zerubaabeelinna, Iyyooseedeqik belti Iyyaasu ittanni weli gateek insa'neeki dayyuwwi qeesenna Leewito, booji'otenaa'ni Iyyerussaalemi'a illee iima higeeki duuchchi sanfe, Leewwitonna lame tomme woggana'ni sanfeexxi ookkoneechchi iimi darree hedheeka Duuchchi Woddike Goottika mini hujinsaashsha insa'nee towataashsha fille. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Iyyaasunna isixxi labbaxxi oosenna isik dayyuwwi Yohoodayaxxi horte Qadimi'eelinna isixxi labbaxxi oose, Henadaadixxi labbaxxi oosenna insa'neexxi dayyuwwa Leewwito duuchchi Mageniinka mine ijaaraaka manna towatatee mitteba afemme. <verse eid="EZR 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Mine ijaaramaki manni Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmiinxa booso ke'issine baro, qeese qeesumatixxa seemma oddo'wite'e malagata anga abixxiteexxi, Leewwichcho Asaafixxi labbaxxi oose kinni qiqillisa anga abixxiteexxi, Isira'eelika moyanjo, Daawwitixxe akeetteshshanni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta saadiyyotee bakka abixxite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1">1 Odo. 25:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Saadinotinna galatiki, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti eloke kadeemmaxxee, isi Isira'eeli'a afe'eexxi jaalalanna duuchchi woddixxen» hina'ni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta faarsine; Mageniinke minixxi booso ke'isendemmaxxee ardi duuchchinna hafuura gikki asseexxi ililisa'n Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galateeffate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Odo. 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Odo. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Far. 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Erm. 33:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Edi woddika galma uddemmaxxi heddo qeese geedhe, Leewwitotikinna mini mini hadiki akeekisanjuwwi konne galmixxi booso ke'isende'na'a uundeexxa yanna haafura gikki assineexxi oo'ne; weli kinni gammada'n ililise. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Ardiinxi raare hara bira saxxeexe kaddeemmaxxe'e gammashshotixxa ililleette oodhishatixxe hunbaashanaa'n gargar hiissa dande'eek manji hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Galmi Qammalchemabaashsha Ke'eeka Diina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Yihudiinkinna Biiniyaamiki naaphuwwi booji'otenaa'n illee iima higeeki manni galma Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Mageni'a ijaarate'n hedheexxa laqeexxi, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />Zerubaabeeliba'anna mini minke haduwwike akeesanjuwwiba'a dangeexxi insa'nee'e, «No'onna ha'noshshanni Mageno ha'nooka halsina'enneken; Asoorik moyanji Asiradoni no'oo kaba iyyedageexxe yannanaa'n telchi qico'ni isi'a tolcha tolchina'nee he'nenneni; tennexxee no'onna ha'nonni welti hunjo» hine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:24-41">2 Moy. 17:24-41</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Zerubaabeli, Iyyaasunna weli Isra'eelike mini minke akeekisanjuwwi kinni insa'nee'e, «No'oke Mageni'a galma ijaartino'a no'onni welti ha'no'o afensisaachchi mittilchinna hedhebaani. Faarsik moyanji Qiroosi no'o ajajemmashshani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Mageni'a galma no'o calla ijaarrannon» hine hiissine haasone. <verse eid="EZR 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Ookkonechchi uduma bogiink manni Yihudiinka arda hoodisa'n hujetanna hunjabaashsha sodaachchisate'n ke'e. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Faarsiki moyanji Qiroosi moyeeke baronaa'n Faarsik moyanji Daariyoosi moyeeke bari qico'ni yaada insa'neeka dokonkorisaaka manna maallaqiki insa'nee hirre.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arxeeksiske Baro'n Ke'eeka Wele Diina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Arixxekisiissi moyeeke baro'ni sirete'ni Yihudakenna Iyyerusaalemike manna'ni ku'latixxa borro insa'ne'ni borreessine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:1">Ast. 1:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Faarsik moyanji Arixxeekisiissi moyeeke baro'ni Biishilaami, Meetridaaxu, Xaabi'eelinna isixxe gamok manni Arixxeqisiissiba borro borreesse; borrotinna borreesende'ammak Aramayike borronni Aramayike laagadinnitemman.<verse eid="EZR 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Bogiink galchalli Rehuuminna borreesanji Simisayi Iyyerusaalemi'i diinati moyanjo Arixxekisisi'n hine borreessine qici:<verse eid="EZR 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />Borrotinna borresendeeki bogiinka galchallo Rehuuminaa'n, borreesanjo Simisayi Tiriipoolisi'ni, Faarsi'n, Arki'ni, Baabilooni'ninna ittanni Suusa Eelaamike manna'n hayyome'emmakerinaa'ninna galcalluwwake kade'emmake insa'neexxe gamonaa'n, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />ittanni lumokinna ulfate'eek Asinaaferi iyyedageexxi Samaariyake qachcha'ninna Efiraaxisike galaani wido ofo'laashsha asseeke wele arduwwinaa'niten. <verse eid="EZR 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Insa'nenna iso'n ergineemmaxxe borroxxi koppe hita'e'ema qici, «Efiraaxiisike galaani wido hedheeke atike erganjuwwanaa'n moyanjo Arixekisisi'a ergendeexxee: <verse eid="EZR 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Atibaa'n no'oba'a dageeki Ayihudiink manni Iyyerussaalemi marreexxi jallaameessakanna fuggichcha qachcha qammalchaten hedheen; dalla'uwwa isikanna qammalchate'ninna booso isixxa haaroba ijaarte'n hedheexxa moyanjoke'n ege'nendowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Ookko iimanni kinni kunni qachchi ijaaremoole, dalla'uwwi isikinna qammalchemoole, qaraxakanna irbo yookaan gibira uunabaaxxa, mootumatike minike maallaqixxi aaggonna heeno'mitaaxxa moyanjoke'n ege'nendeexxe kaddowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Ta'a no'o'o la'o mootumatike minenaa'n alfina'anaaxxee, moyanjiinxa ulfeesema gophanna uunda'n sammi hiyya hasissabaaxxe kaddeexxa undennaxxee, tinni yaane moyanjoke'n ege'nendo'a tenne erga ergine'ennen. <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />Tennexxee edike atike annuwwika jirtetika maxaafa adda uudemmowwaal; konne maxaafuwwi giddo kunni qachchi jallaameessa qachcha kadeexxa, moyanjuwwakanna awuraajiinka galichalluwwa hitta rakkiseexxenna hundi'ninni xaqarondi kexxeebi isinaa'nite kaddeexxa dhuga'a affatton; konne edonna konne qachchixxe ba'ne'a buuto tennetemman. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Kunni qachchi qammalcheme'e dalla'uwwi isikinna ijaaremeexxe kaddoole Efiraaxisi wido mittelchonna moyanji affebexxoxxa egendotta'a eena'ennen. <verse eid="EZR 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Moyanjikinna konnechichnni butti'a hedheeka hiissichcho erge: bogiinka galchallo Rehuumi'a, borreessanjo Simisayi'a ittanni Semaari'a giddonna Efiraaxisi wido hedha'neeke insa'neexxe gamo'a, nage'i ha'no'a kadowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Ane'n ergitineemmaxxi borro ani edo tikende'e haasosende'een. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Aninna ajaja uwweena'a jirotik maxxaaffuwwi adda giddo uudemeena'a kunni qachchi hundii'ninni moyanjuwwake'n jalla'n turiyyoti jallichchakenna fuggoxxe yaane ke'ito kadeexxa dhugaa afende'een. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Iyyerusaaleminna Efiraaxisi wido hedheeka boga duuchcha galchaammaka, qaraxxa, gibirakanna irbo adhdha'emmaka jajjajabba moyanjuwwa afe'emani. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Ta'anna ani ajaja uwwanno qico'n konni qachchi qammalchemabaashsha huje uurrito'a konne mambe'a erga sa'isse. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Tenne yaane'n gaga'mi hitinabaashsha heqedhdhe; mayeeta moyanjuwwake'n miidhensha bira sa'a'n me'itataa?» <verse eid="EZR 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Moyanji Arixxekisiisixxi borro Rehuumi'ni, borreessanjo Semsayi'ninna insa'neexxe gamoke manni edo haasossendeeshanni, iikki woddi Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke Ayihudiinke ardiba marreexxi hunati huje uurritaashsha assine. <verse eid="EZR 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Tennexxee Iyyerusaalemi giddo ijaaremamaake Mageniink minixxi huje Faarsika moyanjixxe Daaryoosi moyeeke barixxe langaxxe wogga qico'ni huje uurrite.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s1">Daariyoosiba'a Ergendeexxa Tentinayixxa Borro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Eettene yanna'ni iikki wabeek Haagenna Addoki belti wabeek Zekkariyasi, Yihuda'ninna Iyyerusaalemi giddo hedheeke Ayihudiinke manni'a Isira'eelike Magenike summinni raaga insa'ne'n haasonne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:1">Hag. 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Zek. 1:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Selatiyyaliki belti Zerubaabelinna Iyyooseedeeqiki belti Iyyaasu Iyyerusaalemi giddo hedheeka Mageniinka mine qammalchino'a ke'ne. Insa'nee gargaarta'emmaxi Mageniinxi wabeekonna insa'nenni welti hexxeman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:12">Hag. 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:6-9">Zek. 4:6-9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Eettene yanna Efiraaxisi wido galchalloke kade'emmak Teentiinayi, Seteribuuzinayinna insa'neexxe gamok manni marreexxi insa'ne'e, «Konnee galma qammalchitino'anna dalla'a isikanna haaroba ijaartino'a ayyete ha'no'a eetti uwwe?» hine qorre. <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Ittanni insa'nee, «Konnee galma ijaara'neeke mannki summi ayyeera?» hine qorre. <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Yaane kinni Ayihudiinka akeekisanjuwwa Mageni heqqa'ammaxxee yaane Daariyoosibaa geyyeeka borreeka hiissichcho alfina qico'n huje hunjabaashsha hoyyemmebaan. <verse eid="EZR 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Eefiraaxisi wido galchalloke kade'emmake Tentinayi, Seteribuzinayinna insa'neexxe gamok manninna Eefiraaxisi wido hedhemmak ja'laabuwwi moyanjo Daariyoosiba ergineeke borreesixxi koppe konneechchinni butti'a hexxeen: <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Erigeneeki borreesinna moyanjo Daariyoosi'a, ulfinniinka nage'a ati'a shiqinsha'nenni. <verse eid="EZR 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Lumoke Magenik galmi ijaarema'neeke Yihudake Awuraajiba marreennaxxa moyanjoke'n ege'nendowwaal. Ardikinna galma lumollamma kinjinni ijaara'n dalla'akanna fufurdallamma gubbo haqqenni hujate'n hedheen; hujetinna si'ik hujenda'n insa'neexxe akeette hunda ariiteti me'ate'n hexxeen. <verse eid="EZR 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />No'onna akeekisanjuwwa, «Konne galma qammalchitino'anna konnee dalla'a haaronsitino'a ayyete ha'no'a eetti uwwe?» hine qorrenne. <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Insa'neeke akeekisanjuwwika summa ate'n borroti ege'nishshonna'a summa insa'neekanna qorrenne. <verse eid="EZR 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />Insa'nenna uuneeki hiissichchi, «No'o iima buttatike Magenike erganjuwwan; ta'a qammalchina'ennek kunni galmi heddi bari ediga'ma lumoki Isira'eeliki moyanji ijaare bire'emmaken. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Yaane kinni annuwwi no'oki iimika Mageno mufachchiise'emmaxxee, Baabiloonike moyanji'a Keledaawichcho Naabukedenetsoorixxe anga'n sa'isse insa'nee uwwe; isinna konnee galma findigeexxi arda booji'e Baabilooni'a adhdhe me'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-12">2 Moy. 25:8-12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-20">2 Odo. 36:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:12-15">Erm. 52:12-15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Kaddo malee'e Qiiroosi Baabiloonike moyanjo kade moyeexxe siretixxe wogga'n kunni Mageniinka mine qammalchemo'a Qiiroosi ajaja uwwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:2-11">Izr. 1:2-11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Isi Naabukedenetsoori Iyyerusaalemike galmi giddii'n aadheexxi Baabilooni hedheeke galmi giddo uggeemmaxxa Mageniinke minixxa worqenna birretika miyuwwa Baabiloonike galminaa'n idagisiise. Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Qiiroosi konne woyyichcha miyuwwa bogiinxe galchallo asseeke Sesabisaari hiyyemaake manjichcho'n uwwe. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Isoonna, ‹Konnee mi'uwwa aaxxe mertettexxi Iyyerusaalemike galmi giddo massi; Mageniinki mini edo hedheemmaxxe bakka'n hiisseme ijaaremowwaal› hiyye. <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Tennexxee Sesabisaari dageexxi Iyyerusaalemi giddo ijaarema'neeke Mageniinke galmixxa booso ke'isse; eettene barranaa'n telchi qico'ni ijaaremate'n hedheen; kaddo malee kinni ijaarsi mudebaani. <verse eid="EZR 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />Ta'anna tinni yaane moyanjoke'ni eloxxe labbee leellitole kunni Magenka mine Iyyerusaalemi giddo ijaaremaashsha moyaanjo Qiiroosi darree'ni ajaji uwweemmoole Baabiloonike mootomatike mini giddo massemeemmak maxaafuwwi memmeekiseme uudemaashsha assowwaal; ookkonechchi uduma moyanji tenne yaanexxee maa murte uwweexxa borreesa no'o'ni ergowwaali» hine.<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Daariyoosika Ajaja?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Daariyoosi Baabiloonike miyuwwike mini giddo massemeemmake maxaafuwwi giddo uudemashsha ajaja uwwe. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Yaane kinni Meedoonike awuraajji giddo Ahimta hiyyemaake qachcha'n mitte mirqisanj maxaafi afeme; isi giddo hiyyemne borreessemeemma qici;</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 6:2">Qallitee;<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />Moyanji Qiiroosi moyeexxe siretixxe wogga'n Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke Mageniinke galmixxee uwweek ajaji konneechchinni butti'a hedheeken: Tolchi shiqaaxxe bakka kadaashsha galmi qammalcheme ijaaremowwaal; booso isixxinna ke'isendowwaal; ejjuma isixxi jaane tomme ciqile, godobi isikinna jaane tomme ciqile kadowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Sase dala, lumollamma kinokenninna gubbo haqqeke mitte dalinni ijaaremowwaal; hasisaake maallaqi duuchchinna mootummatike mi'ike mininaa'n uwwemowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Iittanni Naabukedenetsoori Iyyerusaalemike galmi giddii'n aadheexxi Baabilooni iyyemareemmak Mageniinke minik worqetikinna birretike sibiljik miyuwwi Iyyerusaalemi edi wodda hedhamaaxxe bakka'n galmi giddi'a illee iima hiissinowwaal; Mageniinke mini giddonna massemowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Ta'anna Eefiraaxisi wido bogiinke galchallo kadde'ettek Tentinayi, Seteribuzinayinna ha'no ookkone awuraaji giddo hexxineek insa'neexxi gamo duuchchi ookkoo'ni bayyatte. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Ookko Mageniinke galmixxe huje'n giddo makendinoqqe'e; konnee Mageniinka mine Yihudake bogik galchallinna Ayihudiink akeekisanjuwwi edixxe isixxe bakka'n hiissine ijaarrowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Ittanni kinni Ayihudiinki akeekisanjuwwi konnee Mageniinka mine ijaarraa wodda insa'nee gargaartino'a ha'no'o ajajeennen; tinninna huje uurritabaashsha hasisaaka maallaqa duuchcha Eefiraaxisi widii'n afemaake mootummatike minixxe iribotike maallaqanaa'n uwwemowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Iimike Mageni'a ciincatike tolcha kadaashsha hasisaachchi duuchchi: jiboota, gedhebiinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa insa'ne'a uwwe; ittanni dinne, maxine, woyinetixxa bookanna zayite Iyyerusaalemi hexxeexxi qeese laqqaaxxe qixxe'n hoyyemabelo barra barra'ninni insa'ne'a uwwemowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Tinni kadiyyo hasisseechchi iimika Mageno gammachiisaaka tolcha shiqinsho'anna moyanjokeenna isixxe labbaxxe ooseke fayya'a soodanto'aten. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Ittanni kinni konnee ajaja jijjiiraak fedheeki manji hedheexxe kaddoole isike minik utuphi gonshemeena'a ookkone utupha'n fannisemaashsha, isixxe balleesaxxeenna mini isiki diigemeexxi kora hunemaaxxe bakka kadaashsha ajaje'ennen. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Konnee ajaja jijjiiro'a Iyyerusaalemi hedheeka galma diigo'a hobbi hiyyaaka hoone moyanjo yookaani arda, summi ifik ookko hedheeshsha assemmak Mageni iso'o balleesso'o. Ani Daariyoosi kunni ajaji wo'ma qicinni muxxemaashsha ajaje'ennen.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galmiinke Ijaarsixxa Muuxxenshanna Eebbisensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Daariyoosi ajajemmashaani Eefiraaxisi wido bogiinke galchallo kade'emmak Tentinayi, Seterbuzinayinna insa'neexxe gamok manni huje si'ik muxxendaashsha assine. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Tennexxee Ayihudiinki akeekisanjuwwi wabeekichcho Haagekenna Odoke belto wabeeka Zekkariyasike wabeekummatike haaso'inni jabaanteexxi huje me'inse; galmiinka ijaarsanna Isira'eelike Mageniinke ajajishshanna ittanni Faarsika moyanjuwwa Qiiroosi, Daariyoosinna Arixxekisiisi uunemmake ajajishshanni ijaarre birre.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:1">Hag. 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Zek. 1:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Galmiinki ijaarsinna moyanji Daariyoosi moyeexxe jiyaxxe wogga'n Adaari hiyyemaake agenjixxe sakkaxxe barra'ni muuxeme. <verse eid="EZR 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eeliki ardi, qeese, Leewwitotikinna booji'eme higeemmaki manni Mageniinke minnixxe eebbaka ayyaana gammadik ulfeessine.<verse eid="EZR 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Konne Mageniinke minxe eebake ayyaani'anna dhibba jiboota, lame dhibba gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, shoole dhibba gedhebiinka buruusa uune; Isira'eeli duuchchiingixxe cubboke tolchi'a kaddaaxxa tommenna lame re'etixxa korbeeyye, mitte mitte, Isra'elixxe gosake minixxe qixxe'n shiqinshe. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Muuseke maxaafa'ni borreessendemmashshanni Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke Mageniinke minxe ergatensha'a qeese insa'neeke qooddi qooddishshanni, Leewitotikinna ergatematike qorbi qorbinni qoonde.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Booji'eme higeemaki manni taakesoke agenjiinxe tommenna shoolgaxxe barra'n sa'atika ayyaana ulfeesse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Fula. 12:1-20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Qeesetinna Leewwito ifi ca'a asse'ne; seeriinxe aadashsha duuchchingi ca'a hiyye'emmani. Leewwitotikinna sa'atike ayyaanika buruusa booji'eme higeemmake manni duuuchchi'a, ifika dayyuwwa qeestinna umo ifikee dulde. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Tennexxee booji'eme higeemmaki Isira'elik manni, Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Isira'eelika Mageno magenooffato'a mageno ege'nebaake olla'inke mannixxe battoomanaa'n ifi gargar hiisseexxi welti inde <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'ne gammandaashsha assemmaxxe kebbotika ayyaana torbaane barra gammadik ulfeessine tinninna Mageni Asoorike moyanjika godoba shaqqisheexxi, Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Isira'eelike Magenika mine ijaarraasha asseemmaxxeeteni.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Izira Iyyerusaalemi Dageexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Tenne yaanuwwa uduma Faarsik moyanji Arixxeekisiissi moyeeke baro'ni Izira Serayake belto kadaa wodda, Saraya Azaariyaasike belton, Azaariyaasi Hilqiyaasiyake belton Hilqiyaasi Seloomekiki, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Seloome Saadooqike belton, Saadooqi Ahixoobike belton, Ahixoob Amaariyake belton, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Amareya Azaariyaasike belton, Azaariyaaasi Merayotike belton Merayooti Zera'iyake belton, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Zerahiyya Uuzike belton, Uuzi Buqike belton, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buqi Abishu'ake belton, Abisu'a Finhaasike belton, Finhaasi Ali'aazaarike belton, Ali'aazaar Aarooni qeesete umike belton, <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Izira kunni Baabilooni'ni dage. Isinna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isira'eelik Mageni Muuse'ni uwweemmaka seera quncu asse'e ege'nemmake seerinnke barsiisanjomman; Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ifike Magenixxi hunna iso'ni hexxemmaxxe isi laqechcho duuchcha moyanji uwwe. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Iittanni mitti mitti Isira'eelike mannanaa'ni qeesoletenaa'ni, Leewwitotenaa'n, Faarsaaleyyetenaa'n, hulatike heqqanjuwwa'ninna galmi giddo ergatemammak Arixxeekisiissi mootummatike baro'ni torbakee agenjo'ni Iyyerusaalemi dange. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Izira Moyanji Arixxeqisiissi moyeexxe torbaxxe woggake ondike agenjo'ni Iyyerusaalemi geye. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Jabaxxi Mageno ifikixxi hunna iso'n hexxemmaxxe Baabiloonii'n siretike agenjixxe taakkaxxe barra'ni ke'eexxi ondike agenjixxe takkaxxe barra'ni Iyyerusaalemi geye. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Izira Duuchchi Woddike Goottika seera qote qo'nisati ajajematinna seeriinxa aaduwwanna ajajuwwa Isira'eelike arda'n barsiisati hedho ifixxa uwwe'emman.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moyanji Arixxekisiisi Izira'ni Uwweeka Borreesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isira'eeli'a uwweemmake seerinninna ajajin muxxe kade'eke, qeesichchi'aanna barachchiisanjo Izira'aa, moyanji Arixxeekisiissi uwweemmaxxe borroxxi koppe,<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />Moyanjo Arixekisiisinaa'ni, iimike Magenike seerike barsiisanjo kade'eeke Iziraa'a qeesichchi'a</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 7:12">Nage'i ati'a kadowwaal.<verse eid="EZR 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />Anxe mootumma giddo hedheek Isira'eelik ardi, qeesetinna, Leewwitotanna mitteba atinni welti Iyyerusaalemi'a me'a hasa'neek fedheek Isra'eelawichchi me'a dande'aaxxa ani konnee ajaja uwwe'ennen. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Ati anga atixxe'n hedheeke atike Magenika seera uuddaaxxen, Yihudanna Iyyerusaalemi giddo hexxeexxa yaane hubbattotta'a moyanji ani anke torbaane mari'etke manninni ate'e erge'ennen. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Tinni hexxeeshsha hexxee'na'a Iyyerusaalem hedha'neeke Isira'eelike Mageni'a ani moyanjikinna ank gorsalluwwi fedhi no'oxxen uunenneka birretika sbiljonna worqe aaxxe me'i. <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />Ittanni Baabiloonike awuraajjinaa'ni aaxxetteke birretika sibiljonna worqe duuchcha, ardikinna qeese Iyyerusaalemi hedha'neeke ifike Mageni'a fedhi ifixxenni uuneexxa uwwa duuchchanna aaxxe me'i. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Konne maallaqinni jiboota, gedheebinxa korbeeyyenna gedhebiinka buruusuwwa, welti tolchendaaxxe midhatixxe uwwuwwanninna ha'watixxa uwwuwwa mitteba hirtaattexxa mee dedhi; konneechchuwwanna Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke ha'nooke Mageni galma'n giddo hedheeke tolcha'n shiqishshatton. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Ookkoo'ni gattaaxxa worqenna birretika sibiljo ha'nooke Magenixxe fedheshsha atinna atik dayyuwwi Ayihudi, ha'no'o eeyyissaaxxe yaanexxe huje'ni hosisse. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Mageni atikike galmi giddo hujete'n hoso'a ate'n uwwemeeka miya duuchcha Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke atike Mageni edo shiqishi. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Ittanni Mageni atikike galmi'a uutotta'a hasisaachchco duuchcha moyanjiinke maxaafinke minena'ni adhdha dandeettattoni. <verse eid="EZR 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />Ani moyanji Arixxekisiisi Eefiraaxisi wido hedheeke miyiinke minike ja'laabuwwi duuchchi'a, iimike Magenike seerik barsiisanji, qeesichchi Izira ha'noo laqaachcho duuchcha rakkine uutinaashsha ajajeennen. <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />Sase kumanna shoole dhibba kiiloo qico birreti sibiljo, tomme kuma kiiloo qico dinne, lame kuma liitire qico woyinetika bulbulo, lame kuma liitire qico ejersiinxa zayitenna hasissaa qicixxa maxine isi'a uwwe. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Iimiki Mageni ajajeexxa duuchcha, iiimike Magenike galmi'a jabaxxe xexxe'achchonni muuxema hasiissaani; mayeeta Mageniinxi mufe moynjoke'ninna isixxe oose'n gelta? <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Ittanni kinni ha'no'o qeesete'n, Leewwitote'n, faarsaaleeyete'ni, hulatike heqqanjuwwa'ni, galmi gidike ergaanjuwwa'n, yookaan konne Mageniinke minike wele erganjuwwa'n qaraxxa irbotanna wele uwwuwwa insa'ne'n ibisatika baallooma affinebaaxxa tenne ege'ne. <verse eid="EZR 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />Ati kinni koo Izira Mageni atiki ati'a uwweemmake beekkumishshanni Efiraaxisi wido hedheeke ardi duuchchi'a atike Mageniinka seera ege'neeka hayyichchuwwanna galchalluwwa arda akeeko'a hariir; seera ege'nebaak manji hedhoole ati iso'o barsiisi. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Atike Mageniinke seeri'anna moyanjokee ajajemabaak huuni manjinna reyo yookaani bogake'naa'n shorrensha, yookaan karratixxi boji'ensha yookaan usurri iso'n geyaan. <verse eid="EZR 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Iyyerusaalemi hedheeki Mageniinki mini iitta ulfeessemaashsha yaada konne'e moyanjoke'n uggeeki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti no'oke annuwwik Mageni isi saademowwaali. <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />Ittanni moyanjoke'ni, moyanjiki mari'etike manna'n jajjabbi Ja'laabuwwi duuchchi edo elle alfannoshsha asseki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti galateffatemowwaal; Duuchchi Woddika Gootta anike Magenxi hunna ane'ni hexxemmaxxe, aninni welti me'o'a Isira'eeli giddii'ni akeekisano bukki assonna'a hunna alfenne.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Iziranni Welti Illee Iima Higeeke Mini Minike Akeekisanjuwwika Summa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Moyanji Arixxeekisiissixxe mootummatike baro'n Baabilooninnaa'ni aninni welti fuleeke mini mini hadike akeekisanjuwwi konnechchi butta hedheekeran.<verse eid="EZR 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Finhaasixxe hortenaa'n Geersooni, Itamaarixxe hortenaa'ni Daani'eli, Daawwitixxe hortenaa'n Haxuushi, <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />Isinna Seekeeniyaxxe hortenaa'niten. Faaroosixxe hortenaa'n Zekkariyasinna isinni welti borreeseme'emmak 150 labballi. <verse eid="EZR 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Fehaati Mo'aabixxe hortenaa'n Zerahiyyaki belti Eliyeho'enaayinna isinni welti 200 labballi; <verse eid="EZR 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Zaatuxxe hortenaa'n Yahazi'eelik belti Sekeeniyanna isinni welti 300 labballi; <verse eid="EZR 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Adiinixxe hortenaa'n Yoonaattaaniki belti Eebidinna isinn welti 50 labballi; <verse eid="EZR 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Eelaamixxe hortenaa'n Gotooliyaki belti Yeeshayanna isinn welti 70 labballi; <verse eid="EZR 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Sefaxiyaasixxe hortenaa'n, Mika'eeliki belti Zibadiyanna, isinni welti 80 labballi; <verse eid="EZR 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Iyyo'aabixxe hortenaa'n Yihi'eeliki belti Abidiyunna isinni welti 218 labballi; <verse eid="EZR 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Baanixxe hortenaa'n Yoosefiyaki belti Selomiitinna isinni welti 160 labbali; <verse eid="EZR 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Bebaayixxe hortenaa'n Bebaayiki belti Zekkariyasinna isinni welti 28 labballi; <verse eid="EZR 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Azigaadixxe hortenaa'n Hakataaniki belti Yohananinna isinni welti 110 labbaalli; <verse eid="EZR 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Adooniqaamixxe hortenaa'n udu'meemakeeri summuwwi, Elifaalaati, Iy'u'eelinna Shemaya, Shemaya insa'nenni welti 60 labballi; <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Bigiwwayixxe hortenaa'n Utayinna Zakuri insa'nenninni welti 70 labballi. Iyyerusaalemi'a Illee iima Higa <verse eid="EZR 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Aninna Aahawwa'a yaa'ammake galaani bira manna bukki assenne; ookkonna sase barra turrenne; ardakanna qeese uuddanno wodda, mitte Leewwitonna ookko afebe'no. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Tennexxee Eli'eezer, Ari'eeli'i, Shemayaa'a, Elinataani'i, Yaaribi'i, Elinaata'a Nataani'i, Zekkariyasinna Mesulaamii, ittanni barsiisanjuwwa Yoyaaribinna Elinataani'i ye'isenne. <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />Insa'nenna Kaasifiyaa hiyyemaake booncho'ni akeekisanjoke kadeeke Idobaa ergennexxi, Idonna isik fir, Kaasifiyake galmik erganjuwwi, Mageno no'okike mini giddo ergatemaaka manna iyyedango'a kullaashsha insa'ne'n kulene. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />No'oke Magenixxi hunna no'oni hexxemmaxxee, Mahilixxe hortenaa'n ege'na'a afe'eeka Isira'eelika belto Leewwito Seeraabiya hiyyemaka manjichchonna isinni welti tommena saddeeta isixxa labbaxxa oosenna isika dayyuwwa idange. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />Ittanni Hashabiyaani'i, Meraarixxe hortenaa'ninna Yeshaayya'a, dayyuwwa isikanna isixxe dayyuwwaka lame tomme labballo iyyedange. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Insa'nenna lenbeexxi Daawwitinna isiki ja'laabuwwi Leewwito gargaaro'a qophpheessinemmaka 220 galmiinka erganjuwwa idange; kunni duuchchingi summi summik borreesemme. <verse eid="EZR 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Mageni no'oki edo ifi salphisate'e, orikinna no'o'a no'oxxe oose'aanna, no'oxxe karra duuchchi'a qajeelo'a ookko, Aahawwake wodi'i bira agabo goddo lallabenne. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />«Mageni no'okixxi hunna isoo'o harsaake duuchcha'ni hexxaani, mufe isixxi kinni iso'o waalaake duuchcha'niten» hinennexxi moyanjoke'n haasonne'ennaxxee'e orake'n no'o'o naaphakenaa'n heqqaaka looliinka mannanna, fadhadiinka manna no'o'a uwwo'a moyanjo laqedha shoonkenn. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Tennexxee agabo goddo honsenne, tenne yaanexxee no'oka Mageno soodantenne; isinna soodachcho no'oxxa laqe. <verse eid="EZR 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Aninna akeekisanote kaddeexxe qeesenaa'ni tommenna lame manna, insa'nenni mitteba Seeraabiyanna Hashabiya insa'neeke dayyuwwi giddi'ni tomme manna gargar foyenne. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />Moyanji, isik mari'etik manni, isik ja'laabuwwinna ookko hedheek Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchi no'oke Magenike mini'a uwweeka birretika sibljo, worqetanna wele miya duuchcha killote'n kiille insa'ne'n uwwenne. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />22,000 kiilo birretika sibiljo, 70 kiilo birretike sibiljika mi'uwwa, 3,400 kiilo worqe, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />8 kiilonna 400 giraamixxa 20 worqetixxa qoruwwanna worqetishsha baqisendeexxi cala cala hitaaxxe sageettoke sibiljika lame miya killennexxi anga insa'neexxe'n uwwenne. <verse eid="EZR 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Aninna insa'ne'e, «Ha'nonna kunni miyuwwi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a woyyoondine'een; kunni birretiki sibiljinna worqe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ha'nooke annuwwike Mageni'a eeyuntet shiqe'eeke tolchani. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Konnelchuwwa Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke Duuchchi Woddike Goottike minixxe kuttuwwa giddo akeekisano qeese, Leewwitotanna Isira'eelike mannike mini minike akeekisanjuwwi edo kiildinaa qico'n xexxe'achchoti heqqe» hiyyenne. <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Ookkoneechchi uduma qeesetinna Leewwito Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke no'oke Magenike mine'n iyyemaro'a kiilemeeka birreti sibiljo, worqetanna woyyichcha miyuwwa aa'ne. <verse eid="EZR 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />No'onna taakake agenjixxe tommenna langaxxe barra'n Iyyerusaalemi'a me'inonna'a Aahawwake wodiibaa'n ke'nenne; No'oke Magenixxi hunna no'o'n hexxeman; isinna no'oke naaphuwwanaa'ninna ora sho'ome no'o'o gaadaammakenaa'n no'o'o gatise. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />No'onna Iyyerusaalemi gennennexxi sase barra hafuura adhdhinenne. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Shoolgaxxe barra'n birretika sibiljo, worqetanna woyyichcha mi'uwwa no'oke Magenke mini giddo kiillennexxi Uuriyake belto'ni qeesichcho Meeriimoti'ni uunenne; isinni welti Finihaasik belti Ali'aazaar, Leewwichchi Iyyaasuki belti Yozaabaatinna Biiniwik belti Na'oodi welti he'nemman. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Duuchchingelcho laakkonne kiille; kiilleechcho duuchchanna eettene yanna'ninni borreessine. <verse eid="EZR 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Ookkoneechchi uduma booji'otenaa'n higeeke Isra'eelike manni duuchchi'a tommenna lame jiboota, sallane tommenna jaane gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, torbaane tommenna torbaane gedhebiinka buruusa, ittanni cubbotike tolchi'a kinni tommenna lamme re'etixxa korbeeyye Isira'eelike Mageni'a shiqinshe; kunni duuchchi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqeeke ciincatike tolchaammani. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Moyanjiinka ajajanna ja'laabuwwake'ninna Efiraaxisi wido hedheke bogiinke galchalluwwa'ni uune; insa'nenna ardakanna Mageniinke galmixxa huje gargaarre. Bukki assona'a hunna alfenne.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Alagiki Welti Assineexxe Aadhanna Heerumixxe Iziraxxa Soodachcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Tinni yaanuwwa muuxxendeechchi uduma akeekisanjuwwi aniba dangeexxi: «Qeesetinna, Leewwito Isira'eelike ardinni welti olla'ake'in hedheeka Kenaanike, Hiititootike, Ferizaawike, Iyyaabusike, Amoonike Mo'aabike, Gibtsekenna Amoorake ardixxe battummanaa'ni ifi foonebaan. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Dubaarte insa'nexxa ifi'a aa'ne'e ifixxe labbaxxe oose'ninna aadhi'lsineexxi woyyitte sanne buttatike ardni welti manke'eeni; tenne balleesa'a umoke kade'eemmak ja'laabuwwakenna akeekisanjuwwaken» hiyye.<verse eid="EZR 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Aninna tenne laqennexxa yanna yaaddoti seemma anxa daddarenne; umo anikika ordichchonna areeda corennexxi jabaxxe yaaddonni butta ofo'lenne. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Boji'otenaa'n illee iima higeeki manni elobaaxxa assatenaa'n kexxeexxinni Isira'eelike Magenika haaso'a laqeexxi alayyik culphiseek duuchchi qarqara anike'ni bukki hiyye; aninna galgalik tolchi tolchemaaxxe yanna qico'ni yo'oshsha alayye ookkonni ofo'lenne.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma galgalik tolchi tolchemamma wodda, daddarendeemmaxxa seemma odo'wenneshshanni yaaddoti ofo'lennenabaa'ni ke'ennexxi guluffate'e Duuchchi Woddika Gootta anika Mageno <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />hiyya'ni soodatene qici, «Koo anike Mageno, cubbo no'oxxi no'oke umi iimi darre kadde'een, balleesa no'oxxinna iimi qico'ni gelte'eeni; ee anike Mageno atibaa alba qokki hiyya shookenne; yo'oshshanna sodaatenne. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Edike noke annuwwike baronaa'n ta'i qico'ni balleessa no'oxxi jabaxxen; cubbo no'oxxenaa'n kexxeexxinni telchonna kadeeshanni no'o, no'oke moyanjuwwinninna no'oxxe qeesoleninni alagiinke moyanjuwwixxe anga'ni sa'issemme uwwemennexxi wolaantichchake'ni, booji'emate'ni, saamemate'ninna shookoke'n inbeenneni.<verse eid="EZR 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />«Ta'a kinni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni no'oki hafa no'o'o gatiso'a galmi ifik giddo jabaxxa bakka no'o'a uwwiyyoti shiixxoxxa yanna qattammannoshsha, no'o'a arijoomeeni; tennexxee Mageni no'oki ille no'oxxi ifa uuddo'a asse'een; garbummande'n he'nee'naan heenoxxa yanna no'o'o hafuura adhise. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Garboolleyyetenna kandonole Magen no'oki kinni garbummate'n he'nonna'a no'o'o waalebaani; yaane kinni Faarsike moyanjuwwi edo arjumma ifixxa no'o'ni leellishe; no'oke Mageni mine haaroba ijaarrannoshshanna ole isixxa qammalchinonna'a haaroxxa hedho no'a uwwe; Yihuda giddonna Iyyerusaalemi giddo gollantannoka dalla'a no'o'a uwwe.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />«Ta'a kinni, ee, no'oke Mageno, ta'anni udumi'a maa hinannota? Ajajuwwa atikanna shollinshennaxxe'e; <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />shollinsheennexxi atixxe wabeeko darree'n haasotta'ni, ‹Dhaaldino'a e'yitina'neek bogi giddo hedhemmake ardixxe battummanni batto'edheen; kasakenaa'ninna kasini qico'ni insa'neexxi diqqachchiisaaxxi hujenna battumma bogake'n wo'mite'een. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Tennexxee dubarra ha'nooka insa'neexxe labbaxxe oose'n heerunsiissinoqqe; ha'noonna insa'neexxa dubarte ha'nooxxe labbaxxe oose'n aadhissinoqqe'e; jajjabake kaddinaashshanna bogiinxa elolla yaane ittino'a, oosuwwa ha'nooxxeenna duuchchi woddika geego dhaalchissino'a insa'nenni welti ha'noonna jaalondinoqqe'e› hitettexxi uute'etake ajajan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Fula. 34:11-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:1-5">Lew. 7:1-5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EZR 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />«Tinni duuchchi no'o'n gelteechchi no'oxxe fuggoxxe hujexxeenna bira saxxeexxe no'oxxe balleessaxxe buutonniten; no'oke Magenoo ati kinni no'oxxe balleessaxxe bira sa'neshsha no'o'o xixebexxon; yaane kinni hafe no'o'o gatissetten. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Eega ajajuwwa atika langaxxa qaxxaammura'neexxi iitta hexxeexxa diqachchiissaxxa yaane hujaake arduwwin welt aadha heerumik afema hasissaaxxeeta? Atita hafe gatabaa qico'ni yookaan mitti manjinna gatabaa qico'ni mufattettexxi no'o'o balleessa gophphattotaa? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenoo ati qullichchaken, no'onna telchixxe barra'n gennennexxi hedhoti he'nennen; kunse ati edo no'oxxe cubbonninni shinqe'enen; no'oxxe balleesana'n kexxeexxa kinni ati edo uurra dande'ak ayyinna hedheba'a» hiyye.<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ardi Cubbo Ifixxa Faaci'we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Izira Mageniinke mini edo ibeexxi soodate'emmaxxa, aadde aaga'emmaxxanna oodha'emmaxxa yanna labballi, melaalletinna oose hexxeek laakosi hara bira sa'eek Isira'eelixxi tuuta qarqara isike'ni bukki hite. Insa'nenna iittanni hiiqqinse oo'ne. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Eelaamixxe gosak Yihi'eelik belti, Sekeniya Iziraa hiyyee qici, «Qarqara no'oke'ni hedheeke wele gosake mannanaa'n alaga melaalle aa'nennaxxee'e Mageno no'oke xuurammeeyyete kande afemmebe'no; tinni kadde'na'anni kinni ta'anna Isira'eeli'a addachchiisa hexxe. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Ta'anna atee anike goottike qorsishshanna no'oke Mageniinka ajaja sodataake mannishsha tennee melaalle oose insa'neexxenninni me'itashsha assinonna no'oke Mageni edo kako aango; Mageniink seeri ajajaaxxi duuchchanna assendowwaal. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Tenne duuchchanna assatee yaane uuddaak atete kaddeettaxxee ke'i; no'onna ate'e kinphannon; meeco'o jabaat.»<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Tennexxee Iziranna ke'eexxi umo umo qeese, Leewwitonna Isira'eelika manna duuchcha konnee shiqeeka yaada assinaashsha insa'nee kakachchiise; insa'nenna kakante. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Izira Mageniinke mini edii'n ke'eexxi Eliyaashibika belto, Yohaanaan hedhaammaxxe kuta giddi'a e'ye; iikki booji'eme'emmak manninna xuurameessake kadeexxi afema gophatenaa'n kexxeexxanna oodha'emman; ookkonna midha wode'e afo'ik maaqeba'a. <verse eid="EZR 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma booji'me'emmak manni duuchchi Iyyerusaalmi giddo bukki hiyyaashsha Yihuda giddonna Iyyerusaalemi giddo lallanbe kulle. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Kunni lallabinna sase barra giddo dagebaak huuni manjinna ja'laabuwwikinna geedhe murteexxe muraa qicinni karra isixxi duuchcha adhdhendaashsha umo isikenni isinna booji'emeemmake manni giddii'n fugussemaashsha ajaja'emmakemman. <verse eid="EZR 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Tennexxe sase barra giddo Yihudakinna Biiniyaamik manni duuchchi Iyyerusaalemi giddo bukki hiyye; sallanike agenjixxe lame tommixxe barra'n ardi duuchchi ookko'o bukki hiyyeeexxe yaanexxenna ookkone a'ureeke xeenixxee'e wixixxi hiyyeexxi Mageniinke mini edo hedheeke ba'linna'ni offo'le'emman. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Qeesichchi Iziranna ke'e uurreexxi insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Ha'no xuurameyyetemmabaa'n; Isira'eelixxe balleessa'ni balleessa lebati, alaga melaalle aaxxineen. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Ta'atenna kaddoole Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke edike annuwwike Mageni edo cubbo ha'nooxxee faaci'we; isoo gammachchiissaaxxa yaane duuchcha asse; qarqara ha'noke'n hedheeke wele mannanaa'ninna alaga melaalenaa'n gargar higge» hiyye.<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Tuuta duuchchinna hiteexxi hiissite haassottee qici: «Dhugaate haassootte'etten! Hitettexxa assiyyo no'o hasissaan. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Kaddo malee kaba bukki hiyyee ardi ijiraken; yannatinna haarsoke; tennexxee gadho uurra dandeennabo'no; ookko iimi darrenna tenne yaane'n heddo cubbo hunjennexxee tinni yaane mittete'ninna lame barra giddo muuxendaaxxe yaanebaan. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Tennexxee ja'laabuwwi no'oki tennee tuuta tukkeessemiyyo hasissaaxxa yaane duuchcha assinowwaal; ookkoneechchi uduma tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa daggaaxxi no'oke Magenixxi jabaxxi mufe no'onaa'n higgaa qico'ni qachcha qachcha no'oke'n hedhek alaga melaalle aadheekir duuchchi qachcha qachcha'n hexxeexxe geedhenninna ja'laabuwwinni welt murendeexxe barra'n dangowwaal.» <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Tenne yaane moromeekinna Mesulaaminaa'ninna Leewwichcho Sabatayinaa'n kipha alfeekir Asaheelik belt Yoonaataaninna Teequwwak belt Yahiziyza callan. <verse eid="EZR 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Tennexxe iikki booji'emeemmak manni hiyyendeemmashshanni asse; qeesichchi Iziranna mitte mitte mini haduwwixxe kutanaa'n mitte mitte mini hadika anna kadeeka manjo fi'le; insa'nenna summa insa'ne'ngenni borreessemme. Ookkoneechchi uduma tommike agenjixxe siretixxe barra'n tennee yaane konke uudatee afolle, <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />siretike agenjixxe taakkaxxe barra'n alaga melaalle aadheeka labballo duuchcha egenne birree.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alaga Melaalle Aadheemmaka Manna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Qeesetixxe horte giddii'n alaga melaalle aadhe'emmakir konneechchi butta hedheekeran.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 10:18" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 10:18">Iyyoosediqika belto Iyyaasuxxe horte giddii'ninna isike dayyuwwi giddii'n Me'iseya, Eli'eezer, Yaaribinna Gedaaliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />Kunni duuchchi ifi fixxa are tikatee kakanteexxi anga uune; balleessa ifixxeenna mitti mitting mitte mitte beltanjo balleessatike tolchi'a shiqinshe.<verse eid="EZR 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Imeerixxe hortenaaa'n:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:20">Hanaaninna Zebadiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Hariimixxe hortenaa'n:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:21">Me'imeeya, Eelyaasi, Shemaya, Yihi'eelinna Ooziya.<verse eid="EZR 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Faaskuurixxe hortenaa'n: Eliyo'eenay, Me'iseya, Isima'eeli, Natina'el, Yozabaatinna Eli'aasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Leewwitoti giddii'n.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 10:23" />
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:23">Yozabaat, Seme'i, Qoliixaas hiyyemaak Qooliya, Fetaya, Yihuda, Eli'eezer.<verse eid="EZR 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Faarsitoti giddii'ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:24">Eeliyaashib.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 10:24">Hulatike heqqanjuwwanaa'ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:24">Seeloomi, Xeeleem, Uuri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Wele Isira'eelito giddii'ni.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 10:25" />
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 10:25">Faarosixxe hortenaa'ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:25">raamiya, Yiziiya, Melikiya, Miyaamiin, Ali'aazaar, Melikiyaanna Bennayaasi.<verse eid="EZR 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Eelaamixxe hortenaa'ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:26">Maataaniya, Zekkariyasi, Yihi'eeli, Abdii Yremotinna Eliya,<verse eid="EZR 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Zaatuxxe hortenaa'n:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:27">Eliyaashib, Maataaniya, Yeremooti, Zebadinna Aziiza.<verse eid="EZR 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Bebaayixxe hortenaa'n:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:28">Yihoohanaan, Hanaaniya, Zabayinna Atilay.<verse eid="EZR 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Baanixxe hortenaa'ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:29">Meesulaam, Maluk, Adaya, Yaasuubi, She'aalinna Raamoot.<verse eid="EZR 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Fehaati Mo'aabixxe hortenaa'ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:30">Adina, Kelaali, Bennayaas, Me'iseya, Maataaniya, Baatsili'eeli, Biiniwinna Minaase.<verse eid="EZR 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Harimixxe hortenaa'ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:31">Eli'eezer, Yushiya, Melikiya, Shemaya, Simi'oon. <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Biiniyaam, Malukinna Semaraya.<verse eid="EZR 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Hashuumixe hortenaa'n:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:33">Metinay, Meteta, Zebadi, Eelifeelexi Yereemayi, Minaasenna Seme'i.<verse eid="EZR 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Baanixxe hortenaa'ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:34">Me'iday, Amiraam, U'eel. <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Bennayaas, Beediya, Kelqiya, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Waaniya, Meeriimoot, Eliyaashib, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Maataaniya, Metinayinna, Ya'isu.<verse eid="EZR 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Biinuwwixxe hortenaa'ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:38">Sheeme'i, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Sheelemiya, Naataan, Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Mekinedibay Seeseey, Sheray, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Eezr'eel, Seleemiya, Semaraya, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Seloomi, Amareyanna Yoosefi.<verse eid="EZR 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Naabawwixxe hortenaa'ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 10:43">Yi'i'eel, Metiitiyya, Zebadi, Zebiinna, Yaadayi, Iyyu'eelinna Bennayaasi.<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Kunni duuchchiing alaga melaalle adhe'emmakerammana; insa'nenaa'ni heenok manni tenne melaallenaa'ni oose i'le'emman.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>